Hey folks --

Just bringing this up for discussion. I don't expect it to get implemented
or anything.

I think it would be cool if the game paid attention to time between
keystrokes, and reacted accordingly. This would add to the role-play
element.

For instance, if you are a headstrong Valkyrie, maybe there is a bonus for
rushing into a room of monsters. If you fight fast enough, you are
considered in a berserker rage, and you get a bonus to damage given, and
receive less damage.

Or, maybe you get a damage bonus on the first hit on a monster when you run
smack into them, from the momentum. Maybe some monsters will run if they see
you charging at them.

For a race like elves, who are quick, there would be some kind of bonus for
fast typing, but maybe wizards, who should be contemplative, will get
something bad for quick keypresses.

Maybe a certain god rewards bravery, while another considers rushing into
battle foolhardy.

So, I'm certain there's a lot of other neat things that you can think of.
Let 'em rip!



